{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170746859,"sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","part":{"id":"prt_092e301a1001MqtYiWLjsgcuQV","messageID":"msg_092e2f83c0012haFNTznj720bp","sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","type":"text","text":"I’ll locate the search logic and existing tests, then make a minimal fix to prevent stale requests from updating search state.","time":{"start":1789170745762,"end":1789170746856},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0abb7e1bd6416fa8016aa49439adcc87d1ac3c719cc214318e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789170780516,"sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_u7RmLulPLRMs7vj4yBhj1aXS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Locate search race logic","prompt":"Quick exploration only, no edits. Locate search request/state logic implicated by stale results/loading/errors and relevant test commands. Return files and concise findings.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f6d1cf400ffetwwzWZ1dQ35GG4\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n### Relevant files\n\n- **[src/search/controller.ts:32–45](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/5-1-opencode/repo/src/search/controller.ts#L32)** — Primary race-condition location. Each search unconditionally writes results, errors, and `loading: false`; there is no request identity or stale-response guard.\n  - Older successes can overwrite newer results.\n  - Older failures can inject errors into the current search.\n  - Any completed request can hide loading while a newer request remains pending.\n  - Empty input clears state but does not invalidate pending requests, so late responses can repopulate results/errors.\n  - Preserving previous results while the next search loads is intentional, per the README.\n\n- **[src/api/search.ts:7–17](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/5-1-opencode/repo/src/api/search.ts#L7)** — HTTP adapter: URL-encodes queries, throws on non-OK responses, and returns `payload.items`. No cancellation/`AbortSignal` support.\n\n- **[src/ui/search-view.ts:10–22](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/5-1-opencode/repo/src/ui/search-view.ts#L10)** — Every input event immediately starts a search, allowing overlapping requests. Rendering directly reflects controller results/loading/error. Disposal removes listeners/subscription but does not cancel requests.\n\n- **[tests/search.test.ts:10–62](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/5-1-opencode/repo/tests/search.test.ts#L10)** — Covers initial/empty state, ordinary success/query encoding, ordinary failure/unsubscribe, and view rendering/disposal. **No overlapping-request, out-of-order completion, stale-error, or clearing-during-request tests.**\n\n### Test commands\n\nDefined in **[package.json:5–9](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/5-1-opencode/repo/package.json#L5)**; requires **Node ≥24**, with no third-party dependencies:\n\n```bash\nnpm test\nnode --test tests/search.test.ts\nnode --test --test-name-pattern='ordinary failure' tests/search.test.ts\n```\n\nRead-only exploration completed; no edits or tests run.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","sessionId":"ses_f6d1cf400ffetwwzWZ1dQ35GG4","model":{"modelID":"gpt-6-astra","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Locate search race logic","time":{"start":1789170748416,"end":1789170780514}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0abb7e1bd6416fa8016aa4943acf3487d1b2d2478d89c195cb"}},"id":"prt_092e305e9001Ro9uq2Wv47pXKD","sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","messageID":"msg_092e2f83c0012haFNTznj720bp"}}
