{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170818772,"sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","part":{"id":"prt_092e40d55001IaPWTESyvKAoAr","messageID":"msg_092e406f4001w3kIUdV1hHzQHW","sessionID":"ses_f6d1d087bffessTYLtb0bYfogx","type":"text","text":"Fixed `src/search/controller.ts` with a request counter that advances on every search, including empty queries. Only the latest request can update results, errors, or loading.\n\nClearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests, so late completions cannot repopulate results or display errors. The public API and normal search behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm test`: all 4 existing tests passed.\n- 8 additional in-memory checks passed for stale successes/failures, completion order, and query clearing.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nNo tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789170814293,"end":1789170818771},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0dbb6a33939c0687016aa4947e2fb887d1bc4542b9797086c2","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
